cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "enharmonic: real-time enharmonic pitch spelling for MIDI input"
abstract: >-
  Spells MIDI pitches as note names (C sharp vs D flat) from musical context,
  with no key signature. Four rungs: Core, real-time, look-ahead and an offline
  two-pass speller. Zero runtime dependencies.
authors:
